{"page":149,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:152","surah":6,"ayah":152,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَقْرَبُوا۟ مَالَ ٱلْيَتِيمِ إِلَّا بِٱلَّتِى هِىَ أَحْسَنُ حَتَّىٰ يَبْلُغَ أَشُدَّهُۥ ۖ وَأَوْفُوا۟ ٱلْكَيْلَ وَٱلْمِيزَانَ بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۖ لَا نُكَلِّفُ نَفْسًا إِلَّا وُسْعَهَا ۖ وَإِذَا قُلْتُمْ فَٱعْدِلُوا۟ وَلَوْ كَانَ ذَا قُرْبَىٰ ۖ وَبِعَهْدِ ٱللَّهِ أَوْفُوا۟ ۚ ذَٰلِكُمْ وَصَّىٰكُم بِهِۦ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَذَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Stay well away from the property of orphans, except with the best [intentions], until they come of age; give full measure and weight, according to justice’- We do not burden any soul with more than it can bear- ‘ when you speak, be just, even if it concerns a relative; keep any promises you make in God’s name. This is what He commands you to do, so that you may take heed’-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَقْرَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"go near","transliteration":"taqrabū","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَالَ","en_gloss":"wealth","transliteration":"māla","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْيَتِيمِ","en_gloss":"(of) the orphans","transliteration":"l-yatīmi","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"with that","transliteration":"bi-allatī","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَحْسَنُ","en_gloss":"(is) best","transliteration":"aḥsanu","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَبْلُغَ","en_gloss":"he reaches","transliteration":"yablugha","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَشُدَّهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"his maturity","transliteration":"ashuddahu","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَوْفُوا۟","en_gloss":"And give full","transliteration":"wa-awfū","verse_key":"6:152"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱل