amūna","verse_key":"6:155"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٥٥","en_gloss":"(155)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:155"}]},{"verse_key":"6:156","surah":6,"ayah":156,"ar_uthmani":"أَن تَقُولُوٓا۟ إِنَّمَآ أُنزِلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبُ عَلَىٰ طَآئِفَتَيْنِ مِن قَبْلِنَا وَإِن كُنَّا عَن دِرَاسَتِهِمْ لَغَـٰفِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"lest you say, ‘Scriptures were only sent down to two communities before us: we were not aware of what they studied,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"Lest","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَقُولُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"you say","transliteration":"taqūlū","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّمَآ","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"was revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābu","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":7,"ar":"طَآئِفَتَيْنِ","en_gloss":"the two groups","transliteration":"ṭāifatayni","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَبْلِنَا","en_gloss":"before us","transliteration":"qablinā","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"and indeed","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُنَّا","en_gloss":"we were","transliteration":"kunnā","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":13,"ar":"دِرَاسَتِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their study","transliteration":"dirāsatihim","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَغَـٰفِلِينَ","en_gloss":"certainly unaware","transliteration":"laghāfilīna","verse_key":"6:156"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٥٦","en_gloss":"(156)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:156"}]},{"verse_key":"6:157","surah":6,"ayah":157,"ar_uthmani":"أَوْ تَقُولُوا۟ لَوْ أَنَّآ أُنزِلَ عَلَيْنَا ٱلْكِتَـٰبُ لَكُنَّآ أَهْدَىٰ مِنْهُمْ ۚ فَقَدْ جَآءَكُم بَيِّنَةٌ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ وَهُدًى وَرَحْمَةٌ ۚ فَمَنْ أَظْلَمُ مِمَّن كَذَّبَ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ وَصَدَفَ عَنْهَا ۗ سَنَجْزِى ٱلَّذِينَ يَصْدِفُونَ عَنْ ءَايَـٰتِنَا سُوٓءَ ٱلْعَذَابِ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَصْدِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"or ‘If only the Scripture had been sent down to us, we would have been better guided than them.’ Now clear evidence, guidance, and mercy have come to you from your Lord. Who could be more wrong than someone who rejects God’s revelations and turns away from them? We shall repay those who turn away with a painful punishment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"you say","transliteration":"taqūlū","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنَّآ","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"annā","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"was revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"to us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābu","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَكُنَّآ","en_gloss":"surely we (would) have been","transliteration":"lakunnā","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَهْدَىٰ","en_gloss":"better guided","transliteration":"ahdā","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"than them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"So verily","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":12,"ar":"جَآءَكُم","en_gloss":"has come to you","transliteration":"jāakum","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَيِّنَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"clear proofs","transliteration":"bayyinatun","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:157"},{"pos":15,"ar":"رَّبِّكُمْ","en_gloss":"